d to the National Labor Relations Board, National Transportation Safety Board, Consumer Product Safety Commission, and District of Columbia (DC) courts."}],"actions":[{"date":"2026-07-30","text":"Resolution agreed to in Senate without amendment by Yea-Nay Vote. 50 - 47. Record Vote Number: 217."},{"date":"2026-07-30","text":"Passed/agreed to in Senate: Resolution agreed to in Senate without amendment by Yea-Nay Vote. 50 - 47. Record Vote Number: 217."},{"date":"2026-07-30","text":"Considered by Senate. (consideration: CR S4353, S4360)"},{"date":"2026-07-29","text":"By unanimous consent agreement, vote 7/30/2026."},{"date":"2026-07-29","text":"Considered by Senate. (consideration: CR S4323)"},{"date":"2026-07-29","text":"Cloture on the measure invoked in Senate by Yea-Nay Vote. 50 - 45. Record Vote Number: 214. (CR S4323)"},{"date":"2026-07-29","text":"By unanimous consent agreement, debate and vote mandatory quorum required under Rule XXII waived."},{"date":"2026-07-27","text":"Cloture motion on the measure presented in Senate. (CR S4276)"},{"date":"2026-07-27","text":"Measure laid before Senate by motion. (consideration: CR S4276)"},{"date":"2026-07-27","text":"Motion to proceed to executive session to consideration of measure agreed to in Senate by Voice Vote."},{"date":"2026-07-23","text":"Placed on Senate Executive Calendar under Over, Under the Rule. Calendar No. 6."},{"date":"2026-07-23","text":"Submitted in the Senate Placed on Senate Executive Calendar under Over, Under the Rule. (text: CR S4272-4273)"},{"date":"2026-07-23","text":"Submitted in Senate"}]},"votes":[{"chamber":"Senate","congress":119,"session":2,"roll":217,"date":"2026-07-30","time":"01:46 PM","question":"On the Resolution S.Res. 817","description":"S. Res. 817","result":"Resolution Agreed to (50-47)","amendment":"","amendmentDetail":"","tieBreaker":"","url":"https://www.senate.gov/legislative/LIS/roll_call_votes/vote1192/vote_119_2_00217.htm","xmlUrl":"https://www.senate.gov/legislative/LIS/r